  "title": "Pizza Prosciutto e Rucola",
  "subtitle": "Pizza with Parma ham and rocket added after baking",
  "excerpt": "Pizza prosciutto e rucola is a pizza with a tomato and mozzarella base baked until crisp, then topped after coming out of the oven with thinly sliced Parma ham and a pile of fresh peppery rocket. The contrast of the hot, crisp pizza against the cold, delicate ham and the sharp rocket is what makes this combination so well-suited to summer.",
