  "season": "SUMMER",
  "sourceType": "SYNTHESISED",
  "sourceNotes": "Pizza prosciutto e rucola became one of the most popular pizzas in Italian pizzerie from the 1980s onward, reflecting the Italian appetite for prosciutto crudo as a premium ingredient. The post-bake assembly: ham and rocket added cold: is specific to this pizza and distinguishes it from cooked-topping variants.",
