  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The rule of pizza prosciutto e rucola is that the ham and rocket go on after baking, never before. Parma ham cooked in the oven becomes dry and loses its delicate texture; fresh rocket wilts instantly under the heat. The pizza is baked as a margherita: tomato and mozzarella: then immediately topped with cold Parma ham and fresh rocket as soon as it comes out of the oven. The heat of the pizza warms the ham slightly without cooking it."
          }
        ]
      },
